    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meow Mates</strong> is a platform and puzzle game based on teamwork and collaboration, set in minimalist levels. Players must work together to overcome obstacles and solve puzzles in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game features 40 levels, each offering unique challenges that require cooperation to complete. There is also a single-player mode, allowing players to explore this fun world on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Meow Mates</strong> offers a coin-collecting system to unlock new characters, giving players the ability to choose their preferred cat. Additionally, the game includes Steam achievements and Steam trading cards, offering extra rewards and content.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meow Mates</strong> is a platform and puzzle game based on teamwork and collaboration, set in minimalist levels. Players must work together to overcome obstacles and solve puzzles in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game features 40 levels, each offering unique challenges that require cooperation to complete. There is also a single-player mode, allowing players to explore this fun world on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Meow Mates</strong> offers a coin-collecting system to unlock new characters, giving players the ability to choose their preferred cat. Additionally, the game includes Steam achievements and Steam trading cards, offering extra rewards and content.</p>",
    "short_description": "Meow together, solve together. Meow Mates is a 2D adventure game where feline friends collaborate to progress through challenging puzzles and platforming obstacles. In this charming yet demanding world, you must use cat-like agility and teamwork to move forward.",
